        "Node name for S&R": "TextEncodeQwenImageEditPlus"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Reference image 1 shows the character to preserve. Reference image 2 shows the olive grove setting.\n\nPlace the woman from image 1 into the olive grove from image 2. She stands naturally among the old olive trees, in the same profile orientation as shown in image 1, facing slightly toward the light. Her arm hangs naturally at her side, or her hand rests lightly on a nearby olive branch.\n\nPreserve from image 1 exactly: brown medium-length hair, same profile angle, same clothing, freckles on face and neck, skin tone. Do not modify her face, silhouette, or posture in any way.\n\nMatch the atmosphere of image 2: warm dry Mediterranean afternoon, rocky ground with golden dry grass, silvery-green olive tree canopy creating soft dappled light filtering from the side.\n\nThe result should feel candid and unhurried — she is simply present in this place, not posing. Vertical portrait, 4:5 ratio, subject in the center or slightly left of frame."
      ],
      "color": "#232",
      "bgcolor": "#353"
    },
